e-line"><code node="[object Object]"><span>true</span></code></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="object-param-field border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800 border-b last:border-b-0"><div class="py-6"><div class="flex font-mono text-sm group/param-head param-head break-all relative" id="body-contents-one-of-0"><div class="flex-1 flex flex-col content-start py-0.5 mr-5"><div class="flex items-center flex-wrap gap-2"><div class="absolute -top-1.5"><a href="#body-contents-one-of-0" class="-ml-10 flex items-center opacity-0 border-0 group-hover/param-head:opacity-100 focus:opacity-100 focus:outline-0 py-2 [.expandable-content_&amp;]:-ml-[2.1rem] group/link" aria-label="Navigate to header">​<div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm text-gray-400 dark:text-white/50 dark:bg-background-dark dark:brightness-[1.35] dark:ring-1 dark:hover:brightness-150 bg-white ring-1 ring-gray-400/30 dark:ring-gray-700/25 hover:ring-gray-400/60 dark:hover:ring-white/20 group-focus/link:border-2 group-focus/link:border-primary dark:group-focus/link:border-primary-light"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8.5 6.827C8.148 6.995 7.818 7.225 7.527 7.517L7.517 7.527C6.136 8.908 6.136 11.146 7.517 12.527L9.692 14.702C11.073 16.083 13.311 16.083 14.692 14.702L14.702 14.692C16.083 13.311 16.083 11.073 14.702 9.692L13.771 8.761" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M9.5 11.173C9.852 11.005 10.182 10.775 10.473 10.483L10.483 10.473C11.864 9.092 11.864 6.854 10.483 5.473L8.308 3.298C6.927 1.917 4.689 1.917 3.308 3.298L3.298 3.308C1.917 4.689 1.917 6.927 3.298 8.308L4.229 9.239" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></a></div><div class="font-semibold text-primary dark:text-primary-light overflow-wrap-anywhere cursor-pointer" data-component-part="field-name">contents</div><div class="inline items-center gap-2 text-xs font-medium [&amp;_div]:inline [&amp;_div]:mr-2 [&amp;_div]:leading-5" data-component-part="field-meta"><div class="flex items-center gap-1 break-all rounded-md bg-stone-100/50 px-2 py-0.5 font-medium text-stone-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-stone-200" data-component-part="field-info-pill"><span>object | null</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-4"><div class=""><div class=""><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal prose prose-sm prose-gray dark:prose-invert overflow-wrap-anywhere [&amp;_*]:overflow-wrap-anywhere [&amp;_ul]:list-none [&amp;_ul&gt;li]:before:top-[0.75em] [&amp;_li_p.whitespace-pre-line]:!my-0 [&amp;_li.py-1]:!py-0 [&amp;_li.py-1]:!my-2"><p class="whitespace-pre-line">Content options for text, highlights, summary, extras, and freshness controls.</p></div></div><div class=""><details class="expandable mt-4 rounded-xl border-standard" data-component-part="expandable" data-testid="body-contents-one-of-0-children"><summary aria-controls="child-attributes-_R_3kmnaej4jddbsnlhjiuasnpfiutb_-content" aria-expanded="false" class="not-prose flex w-full cursor-pointer flex-row content-center items-center text-sm rounded-t-xl px-3.5 py-3 text-stone-600 hover:bg-stone-50/50 hover:text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-300 dark:hover:bg-white/5 dark:hover:text-stone-200 list-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden rounded-b-xl" data-component-part="expandable-button"><svg class="icon inline size-2.5 bg-stone-400 transition-transform" data-component-part="icon-svg" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(https://d3gk2c5xim1je2.cloudfront.net/v7.1.0/regular/angle-right.svg);-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-image:url(https://d3gk2c5xim1je2.cloudfront.net/v7.1.0/regular/angle-right.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle"></svg><div class="ml-3 text-left leading-tight"><p class="m-0" contentEditable="false">Show<!-- --> <!-- -->child attributes</p></div></summary><div class="expandable-content mx-3 border-stone-100 border-t px-2 dark:border-white/10" data-component-part="expandable-content" id="child-attributes-_R_3kmnaej4jddbsnlhjiuasnpfiutb_-content"></div></details></div></div></div></div></div><div class="array-param-field border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800 border-b last:border-b-0"><div class="py-6"><div class="flex font-mono text-sm group/param-head param-head break-all relative" id="body-additional-queries-one-of-0"><div class="flex-1 flex flex-col content-start py-0.5 mr-5"><div class="flex items-center flex-wrap gap-2"><div class="absolute -top-1.5"><a href="#body-additional-queries-one-of-0" class="-ml-10 flex items-center opacity-0 border-0 group-hover/param-head:opacity-100 focus:opacity-100 focus:outline-0 py-2 [.expandable-content_&amp;]:-ml-[2.1rem] group/link" aria-label="Navigate to header">​<div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm text-gray-400 dark:text-white/50 dark:bg-background-dark dark:brightness-[1.35] dark:ring-1 dark:hover:brightness-150 bg-white ring-1 ring-gray-400/30 dark:ring-gray-700/25 hover:ring-gray-400/60 dark:hover:ring-white/20 group-focus/link:border-2 group-focus/link:border-primary dark:group-focus/link:border-primary-light"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8.5 6.827C8.148 6.995 7.818 7.225 7.527 7.517L7.517 7.527C6.136 8.908 6.136 11.146 7.517 12.527L9.692 14.702C11.073 16.083 13.311 16.083 14.692 14.702L14.702 14.692C16.083 13.311 16.083 11.073 14.702 9.692L13.771 8.761" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M9.5 11.173C9.852 11.005 10.182 10.775 10.473 10.483L10.483 10.473C11.864 9.092 11.864 6.854 10.483 5.473L8.308 3.298C6.927 1.917 4.689 1.917 3.308 3.298L3.298 3.308C1.917 4.689 1.917 6.927 3.298 8.308L4.229 9.239" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></a></div><div class="font-semibold text-primary dark:text-primary-light overflow-wrap-anywhere cursor-pointer" data-component-part="field-name">additionalQueries</div><div class="inline items-center gap-2 text-xs font-medium [&amp;_div]:inline [&amp;_div]:mr-2 [&amp;_div]:leading-5" data-component-part="field-meta"><div class="flex items-center gap-1 break-all rounded-md bg-stone-100/50 px-2 py-0.5 font-medium text-stone-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-stone-200" data-component-part="field-info-pill"><span>string[] | null</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-4"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal prose prose-sm prose-gray dark:prose-invert overflow-wrap-anywhere [&amp;_*]:overflow-wrap-anywhere [&amp;_ul]:list-none [&amp;_ul&gt;li]:before:top-[0.75em] [&amp;_li_p.whitespace-pre-line]:!my-0 [&amp;_li.py-1]:!py-0 [&amp;_li.py-1]:!my-2"><p class="whitespace-pre-line">Additional query variations for deep-search variants. Only works with a deep-search type. When provided, these queries are used alongside the main query for broader results.</p></div><div class="prose prose-sm prose-gray dark:prose-invert mt-6">Required array length: <code>1 - 10</code> element<!-- -->s</div><div class="primitive-param-field"><div class=""><div class=""></div></div></div><div class="flex prose prose-sm prose-gray dark:prose-invert mt-6 gap-1.5 flex-col gap-y-3"><span>Example<!-- -->:</span><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal prose prose-sm prose-gray dark:prose-invert overflow-wrap-anywhere [&amp;_*]:overflow-wrap-anywhere [&amp;_ul]:list-none [&amp;_ul&gt;li]:before:top-[0.75em] [&amp;_li_p.whitespace-pre-line]:!my-0 [&amp;_li.py-1]:!py-0 [&amp;_li.py-1]:!my-2 overflow-wrap-anywhere text-[13px] [&amp;_*]:text-[13px]"><div class="relative"><pre node="[object Object]" class="shiki shiki-themes p-0 overflow-visible text-sm rounded-xl text-gray-950 bg-white codeblock-light dark:codeblock-dark dark:bg-codeblock dark:text-gray-50 border border-gray-200/70 dark:border-white/[0.14]"><div role="presentation" style="position:relative;--scroll-area-corner-height:0px;--scroll-area-corner-width:0px" data-component-part="scroll-area" class="min-w-0 rounded-[inherit]"><div role="presentation" data-id="base-ui-_R_3l4onaej4jddbsnlhjiuasnpfiutb_-viewport" tabindex="-1" class="size-full rounded-[inherit] [--scroll-area-fade-size:32px] p-3 overflow-y-hidden! base-ui-disable-scrollbar" style="overflow:scroll" data-component-part="scroll-area-viewport"><div role="presentation" style="min-width:fit-content" data-component-part="scroll-area-content"><code node="[object Object]"><span style="color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#D4D4D4">[</span><br><span style="color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#CE9178">  "LLM advancements"</span><span style="color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#D4D4D4">,</span><br><span style="color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#CE9178">  "large language model progress"</span><br><span style="color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#D4D4D4">]</span></code></div></div></div></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="primitive-param-field border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800 border-b last:border-b-0"><div class="py-6"><div class="flex font-mono text-sm group/param-head param-head break-all relative" id="body-type-one-of-0"><div class="flex-1 flex flex-col content-start py-0.5 mr-5"><div class="flex items-center flex-wrap gap-2"><div class="absolute -top-1.5"><a href="#body-type-one-of-0" class="-ml-10 flex items-center opacity-0 border-0 group-hover/param-head:opacity-100 focus:opacity-100 focus:outline-0 py-2 [.expandable-content_&amp;]:-ml-[2.1rem] group/link" aria-label="Navigate to header">​<div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm text-gray-400 dark:text-white/50 dark:bg-background-dark dark:brightness-[1.35] dark:ring-1 dark:hover:brightness-150 bg-white ring-1 ring-gray-400/30 dark:ring-gray-700/25 hover:ring-gray-400/60 dark:hover:ring-white/20 group-focus/link:border-2 group-focus/link:border-primary dark:group-focus/link:border-primary-light"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8.5 6.827C8.148 6.995 7.818 7.225 7.527 7.517L7.517 7.527C6.136 8.908 6.136 11.146 7.517 12.527L9.692 14.702C11.073 16.083 13.311 16.083 14.692 14.702L14.702 14.692C16.083 13.311 16.083 11.073 14.702 9.692L13.771 8.761" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M9.5 11.173C9.852 11.005 10.182 10.775 10.473 10.483L10.483 10.473C11.864 9.092 11.864 6.854 10.483 5.473L8.308 3.298C6.927 1.917 4.689 1.917 3.308 3.298L3.298 3.308C1.917 4.689 1.917 6.927 3.298 8.308L4.229 9.239" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></a></div><div class="font-semibold text-primary dark:text-primary-light overflow-wrap-anywhere cursor-pointer" data-component-part="field-name">type</div><div class="inline items-center gap-2 text-xs font-medium [&amp;_div]:inline [&amp;_div]:mr-2 [&amp;_div]:leading-5" data-component-part="field-meta"><div class="flex items-center gap-1 break-all rounded-md bg-stone-100/50 px-2 py-0.5 font-medium text-stone-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-stone-200" data-component-part="field-info-pill"><span>enum&lt;string&gt; | null</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-1 break-all rounded-md bg-stone-100/50 px-2 py-0.5 font-medium text-stone-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-stone-200" data-component-part="field-info-pill"><span class="text-stone-400 dark:text-stone-500">default:</span><span>auto</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-4"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal prose prose-sm prose-gray dark:prose-invert overflow-wrap-anywhere [&amp;_*]:overflow-wrap-anywhere [&amp;_ul]:list-none [&amp;_ul&gt;li]:before:top-[0.75em] [&amp;_li_p.whitespace-pre-line]:!my-0 [&amp;_li.py-1]:!py-0 [&amp;_li.py-1]:!my-2"><p class="whitespace-pre-line">The search mode to use. <code node="[object Object]"><span>auto</span></code> (default) is a balanced mode that optimizes for both quality and speed and is recommended for most applications. <code node="[object Object]"><span>fast</span></code> returns high-quality results with reduced latency, making it a good fit for user-facing search and interactive workflows. <code node="[object Object]"><span>instant</span></code> is optimized for minimum response time, trading some search depth for speed in real-time experiences such as chat, voice agents, and autocomplete. <code node="[object Object]"><span>deep-lite</span></code> performs lightweight research with synthesized results and a consistent 4-second latency, lower than full deep search. <code node="[object Object]"><span>deep</span></code> conducts comprehensive multi-step research with synthesis, while <code node="[object Object]"><span>deep-reasoning</span></code> adds stronger reasoning for complex analysis and decision-making tasks.</p></div><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap prose-sm mt-6">Available options<!-- -->:<!-- --> <div class="inline-block"><code>instant</code>,<!-- --> </div><div class="inline-block"><code>fast</code>,<!-- --> </div><div class="inline-block"><code>auto</code>,<!-- --> </div><div class="inline-block"><code>deep-lite</code>,<!-- --> </div><div class="inline-block"><code>deep</code>,<!-- --> </div><div class="inline-block"><code>deep-reasoning</code> </div></div><div class="flex prose prose-sm prose-gray dark:prose-invert mt-6 gap-1.5"><span>Example<!-- -->:</span><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal prose prose-sm prose-gray dark:prose-invert overflow-wrap-anywhere [&amp;_*]:overflow-wrap-anywhere [&amp;_ul]:list-none [&amp;_ul&gt;li]:before:top-[0.75em] [&amp;_li_p.whitespace-pre-line]:!my-0 [&amp;_li.py-1]:!py-0 [&amp;_li.py-1]:!my-2 overflow-wrap-anywhere text-[13px] [&amp;_*]:text-[13px]"><p class="whitespace-pre-line"><code node="[object Object]"><span>"auto"</span></code></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="primitive-param-field border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800 border-b last:border-b-0"><div class="py-6"><div class="flex font-mono text-sm group/param-head param-head break-all relative" id="body-category-one-of-0"><div class="flex-1 flex flex-col content-start py-0.5 mr-5"><div class="flex items-center flex-wrap gap-2"><div class="absolute -top-1.5"><a href="#body-category-one-of-0" class="-ml-10 flex items-center opacity-0 border-0 group-hover/param-head:opacity-100 focus:opacity-100 focus:outline-0 py-2 [.expandable-content_&amp;]:-ml-[2.1rem] group/link" aria-label="Navigate to header">​<div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm text-gray-400 dark:text-white/50 dark:bg-background-dark dark:brightness-[1.35] dark:ring-1 dark:hover:brightness-150 bg-white ring-1 ring-gray-400/30 dark:ring-gray-700/25 hover:ring-gray-400/60 dark:hover:ring-white/20 group-focus/link:border-2 group-focus/link:border-primary dark:group-focus/link:border-primary-light"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8.5 6.827C8.148 6.995 7.818 7.225 7.527 7.517L7.517 7.527C6.136 8.908 6.136 11.146 7.517 12.527L9.692 14.702C11.073 16.083 13.311 16.083 14.692 14.702L14.702 14.692C16.083 13.311 16.083 11.073 14.702 9.692L13.771 8.761" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M9.5 11.173C9.852 11.005 10.182 10.775 10.473 10.483L10.483 10.473C11.864 9.092 11.864 6.854 10.483 5.473L8.308 3.298C6.927 1.917 4.689 1.917 3.308 3.298L3.298 3.308C1.917 4.689 1.917 6.927 3.298 8.308L4.229 9.239" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></a></div><div class="font-semibold text-primary dark:text-primary-light overflow-wrap-anywhere cursor-pointer" data-component-part="field-name">category</div><div class="inline items-center gap-2 text-xs font-medium [&amp;_div]:inline [&amp;_div]:mr-2 [&amp;_div]:leading-5" data-component-part="field-meta"><div class="flex items-center gap-1 break-all rounded-md bg-stone-100/50 px-2 py-0.5 font-medium text-stone-600 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-stone-200" data-component-part="field-info-pill"><span>enum&lt;string&gt; | null</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-4"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal prose prose-sm prose-gray dark:prose-invert overflow-wrap-anywhere [&amp;_*]:overflow-wrap-anywhere [&amp;_ul]:list-none [&amp;_ul&gt;li]:before:top-[0.75em] [&amp;_li_p.whitespace-pre-line]:!my-0 [&amp;_li.py-1]:!py-0 [&amp;_li.py-1]:!my-2"><p class="whitespace-pre-line">A data category to focus on. Known categories include <code node="[object Object]"><span>company</span></code>, <code node="[object Object]"><span>publication</span></code>, <code node="[object Object]"><span>news</span></code>, <code node="[object Object]"><span>personal site</span></code>, <code node="[object Object]"><span>financial report</span></code>, and <code node="[object Object]"><span>people</span></code>. Other strings are accepted and used as category hints for search. The <code node="[object Object]"><span>people</span></code> and <code node="[object Object]"><span>company</span></code> categories have improved quality for finding people profiles and company pages. The <code node="[object Object]"><span>publication</span></code> category surfaces scholarly publications such as research papers, preprints, and journal articles, with structured metadata like authors, venue, and citations. Note: The <code node="[object Object]"><span>company</span></code> and <code node="[object Object]"><span>people</span></code> categories only support a limited set of filters. The following parameters are NOT supported for these categories: <code node="[object Object]"><span>startPublishedDate</span></code>, <code node="[object Object]"><span>endPublishedDate</span></code>, <code node="[object Object]"><span>excludeDomains</span></code>. Using unsupported parameters will result in a 400 error.</p></div><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap prose-sm mt-6">Available options<!-- -->:<!-- --> <div class="inline-block"><code>company</code>,<!-- --> </div><div class="inline-block"><code>publication</code>,<!-- --> </div><div class="inline-block"><code>news</code>,<!-- --> </div><div class="inline-block"><code>personal site</code>,<!-- --> </div><div class="inline-block"><code>financial report</code>,<!-- --> </div><div class="inline-block"><code>people</code> </div></div><div class="flex prose prose-sm prose-gray dark:prose-invert mt-6 gap-1.5"><span>Example<!-- -->:</span><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal prose prose-sm prose-gray dark:prose-invert overflow-wrap-anywhere [&amp;_*]:overflow-wrap-anywhere [&amp;_ul]:list-none [&amp;_ul&gt;li]:before:top-[0.75em] [&amp;_li_p.whitespace-pre-line]:!my-0 [&amp;_li.py-1]:!py-0 [&amp;_li.py-1]:!my-2 overflow-wrap-anywhere text-[13px] [&amp;_*]:text-[13px]"><p class="whitespace-pre-line"><code node="[object Object]"><span>"publication"</span></code></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="primitive-param-field border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800 border-b last:border-b-0"><div class="py-6"><div class="flex font-mono text-sm group/param-head param-head break-all relative" id="body-user-location-one-of-0"><div class="flex-1 flex flex-col content-start py-0.5 mr-5"><div class="flex items-center flex-wrap gap-2"><div class="absolute -top-1.5"><a href="#body-user-location-one-of-0" class="-ml-10 flex items-center opacity-0 border-0 group-hover/param-head:opacity-100 focus:opacity-100 focus:outline-0 py-2 [.expandable-content_&amp;]:-ml-[2.1rem] group/link" aria-label="Navigate to header">​<div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm text-gray-400 dark:text-white/50 dark:bg-background-dark dark:brightness-[1.35] dark:ring-1 dark:hover:brightness-150 bg-white ring-1 ring-gray-400/30 dark:ring-gray-700/25 hover:ring-gray-400/60 dark:h