ents.oneOf.0.context.oneOf.2\",\"typeLabel\":\"null\"}],\"uniqueKey\":\"contents.oneOf.0.context\",\"typeLabel\":\"boolean | object | null\"},\"livecrawl\":{\"oneOf\":[{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Deprecated: Use maxAgeHours instead for content freshness control. livecrawl does not guarantee freshly fetched parser output and may be served according to server freshness policy. Do not send livecrawl and maxAgeHours together.\",\"enum\":[\"never\",\"always\",\"fallback\",\"preferred\"],\"deprecated\":true,\"example\":\"preferred\",\"uniqueKey\":\"contents.oneOf.0.livecrawl.oneOf.0\",\"typeLabel\":\"enum\u003cstring\u003e\"},{\"type\":\"null\",\"uniqueKey\":\"contents.oneOf.0.livecrawl.oneOf.1\",\"typeLabel\":\"null\"}],\"uniqueKey\":\"contents.oneOf.0.livecrawl\",\"typeLabel\":\"enum\u003cstring\u003e | null\"},\"livecrawlTimeout\":{\"oneOf\":[{\"type\":\"integer\",\"description\":\"The timeout for livecrawling in milliseconds.\",\"default\":10000,\"maximum\":90000,\"minimum\":0,\"example\":1000,\"exclusiveMinimum\":true,\"uniqueKey\":\"contents.oneOf.0.livecrawlTimeout.oneOf.0\",\"typeLabel\":\"integer\"},{\"type\":\"null\",\"uniqueKey\":\"contents.oneOf.0.livecrawlTimeout.oneOf.1\",\"typeLabel\":\"null\"}],\"uniqueKey\":\"contents.oneOf.0.livecrawlTimeout\",\"typeLabel\":\"integer | null\"},\"maxAgeHours\":{\"oneOf\":[{\"type\":\"integer\",\"description\":\"Maximum age of cached content in hours. Positive values use cached content if it is less than this many hours old; 0 fetches fresh content and is the supported way to apply text rendering options to newly fetched pages; -1 always uses cache; omitted uses fallback fetching when cached content is unavailable. Maximum supported value is 720 hours.\",\"maximum\":720,\"minimum\":-1,\"example\":24,\"uniqueKey\":\"contents.oneOf.0.maxAgeHours.oneOf.0\",\"typeLabel\":\"integer\"},{\"type\":\"null\",\"uniqueKey\":\"contents.oneOf.0.maxAgeHours.oneOf.1\",\"typeLabel\":\"null\"}],\"uniqueKey\":\"contents.oneOf.0.maxAgeHours\",\"typeLabel\":\"integer | null\"},\"subpages\":{\"oneOf\":[{\"type\":\"integer\",\"description\":\"The number of subpages to crawl. The actual number crawled may be limited by system constraints.\",\"default\":0,\"maximum\":100,\"minimum\":0,\"example\":1,\"uniqueKey\":\"contents.oneOf.0.subpages.oneOf.0\",\"typeLabel\":\"integer\"},{\"type\":\"null\",\"uniqueKey\":\"contents.oneOf.0.subpages.oneOf.1\",\"typeLabel\":\"null\"}],\"uniqueKey\":\"contents.oneOf.0.subpages\",\"typeLabel\":\"integer | null\"},\"subpageTarget\":{\"oneOf\":[{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Term to find specific subpages of search results. Can be a single string or an array of strings.\",\"maxLength\":100,\"minLength\":1,\"example\":\"sources\",\"uniqueKey\":\"contents.oneOf.0.subpageTarget.oneOf.0\",\"typeLabel\":\"string\"},{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":1,\"maxLength\":100,\"uniqueKey\":\"contents.oneOf.0.subpageTarget.oneOf.1.items.[INDEX]\",\"typeLabel\":\"string\"},\"description\":\"Term to find specific subpages of search results. Can be a single string or an array of strings.\",\"maxItems\":100,\"minItems\":0,\"example\":\"sources\",\"uniqueKey\":\"contents.oneOf.0.subpageTarget.oneOf.1\",\"typeLabel\":\"string[]\"},{\"type\":\"null\",\"uniqueKey\":\"contents.oneOf.0.subpageTarget.oneOf.2\",\"typeLabel\":\"null\"}],\"uniqueKey\":\"contents.oneOf.0.subpageTarget\",\"typeLabel\":\"string | string[] | null\"}},\"uniqueKey\":\"contents.oneOf.0\",\"typeLabel\":\"object\"},{\"type\":\"null\",\"uniqueKey\":\"contents.oneOf.1\",\"typeLabel\":\"null\"}],\"uniqueKey\":\"contents\",\"typeLabel\":\"object | null\"},\"additionalQueries\":{\"oneOf\":[{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"uniqueKey\":\"additionalQueries.oneOf.0.items.[INDEX]\",\"typeLabel\":\"string\"},\"description\":\"Additional query variations for deep-search variants. Only works with a deep-search type. When provided, these queries are used alongside the main query for broader results.\",\"maxItems\":10,\"minItems\":1,\"example\":[\"LLM advancements\",\"large language model progress\"],\"uniqueKey\":\"additionalQueries.oneOf.0\",\"typeLabel\":\"string[]\"},{\"type\":\"null\",\"uniqueKey\":\"additionalQueries.oneOf.1\",\"typeLabel\":\"null\"}],\"uniqueKey\":\"additionalQueries\",\"typeLabel\":\"string[] | null\"},\"type\":{\"oneOf\":[{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"The search mode to use. `auto` (default) is a balanced mode that optimizes for both quality and speed and is recommended for most applications. `fast` returns high-quality results with reduced latency, making it a good fit for user-facing search and interactive workflows. `instant` is optimized for minimum response time, trading some search depth for speed in real-time experiences such as chat, voice agents, and autocomplete. `deep-lite` performs lightweight research with synthesized results and a consistent 4-second latency, lower than full deep search. `deep` conducts comprehensive multi-step research with synthesis, while `deep-reasoning` adds stronger reasoning for complex analysis and decision-making tasks.\",\"default\":\"auto\",\"enum\":[\"instant\",\"fast\",\"auto\",\"deep-lite\",\"deep\",\"deep-reasoning\"],\"example\":\"auto\",\"uniqueKey\":\"type.oneOf.0\",\"typeLabel\":\"enum\u003cstring\u003e\"},{\"type\":\"null\",\"uniqueKey\":\"type.oneOf.1\",\"typeLabel\":\"null\"}],\"uniqueKey\":\"type\",\"typeLabel\":\"enum\u003cstring\u003e | null\"},\"category\":{\"oneOf\":[{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"A data category to focus on. Known categories include `company`, `publication`, `news`, `personal site`, `financial report`, and `people`. Other strings are accepted and used as category hints for search. The `people` and `company` categories have improved quality for finding people profiles and company pages. The `publication` category surfaces scholarly publications such as research papers, preprints, and journal articles, with structured metadata like authors, venue, and citations. Note: The `company` and `people` categories only support a limited set of filters. The following parameters are NOT supported for these categories: `startPublishedDate`, `endPublishedDate`, `excludeDomains`. Using unsupported parameters will result in a 400 error.\",\"enum\":[\"company\",\"publication\",\"news\",\"personal site\",\"financial report\",\"people\"],\"example\":\"publication\",\"uniqueKey\":\"category.oneOf.0\",\"typeLabel\":\"enum\u003cstring\u003e\"},{\"type\":\"null\",\"uniqueKey\":\"category.oneOf.1\",\"typeLabel\":\"null\"}],\"uniqueKey\":\"category\",\"typeLabel\":\"enum\u003cstring\u003e | null\"},\"userLocation\":{\"oneOf\":[{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"The two-letter ISO country code of the user, e.g. US.\",\"example\":\"US\",\"uniqueKey\":\"userLocation.oneOf.0\",\"typeLabel\":\"string\"},{\"type\":\"null\",\"uniqueKey\":\"userLocation.oneOf.1\",\"typeLabel\":\"null\"}],\"uniqueKey\":\"userLocation\",\"typeLabel\":\"string | null\"},\"compliance\":{\"oneOf\":[{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Enterprise-only compliance mode. Set to `hipaa` for HIPAA mode. Requires cache-only retrieval with supported parameters. See the HIPAA docs for details.\",\"enum\":[\"hipaa\"],\"example\":\"hipaa\",\"uniqueKey\":\"compliance.oneOf.0\",\"typeLabel\":\"enum\u003cstring\u003e\"},{\"type\":\"null\",\"uniqueKey\":\"compliance.oneOf.1\",\"typeLabel\":\"null\"}],\"uniqueKey\":\"compliance\",\"typeLabel\":\"enum\u003cstring\u003e | null\"},\"outputSchema\":{\"oneOf\":[{\"type\":\"object\",\"description\":\"JSON schema for synthesized output. Supported root types are \\\"text\\\" and \\\"object\\\". When provided, the response includes an output object whose content matches this schema. Works with every search type and adds about 2 seconds of synthesis latency on top of the selected search type.\",\"required\":[\"type\"],\"properties\":{\"type\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"const\":\"text\",\"isRequired\":true,\"u